       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. Q1-BALANCE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-OPENING PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-DEPOSIT PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-BALANCE PIC Z(8) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER OPENING BALANCE:".
           ACCEPT WS-OPENING.
           DISPLAY "ENTER DEPOSIT AMOUNT:".
           ACCEPT WS-DEPOSIT.
           IF WS-OPENING < 0 OR WS-DEPOSIT < 0
               DISPLAY "INVALID AMOUNT"
           ELSE
               COMPUTE WS-BALANCE = WS-OPENING + WS-DEPOSIT
               DISPLAY "UPDATED BALANCE: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-BALANCE)
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.